Description: Shareable Rust configuration providing standardized rustfmt and clippy rules adhering to modern 2026 standards
 @sebastienrousseau/rust-config is a shareable configuration preset with no runtime
 dependencies: inert data plus a loader.
 .
 Installed under /usr/share/nodejs so that require() resolves it without
 further configuration.
